# Licence

Symplek is published as a workspace of packages with **per-package licences**.

## MIT — default

The following packages are licensed under the **MIT Licence**. Each package has its own `LICENSE` file with the full text.

- `@symplek/core` — [`packages/symplek-core/LICENSE`](packages/symplek-core/LICENSE)
- `@symplek/react` — [`packages/symplek-react/LICENSE`](packages/symplek-react/LICENSE)
- `@symplek/convex` — [`packages/symplek-convex/LICENSE`](packages/symplek-convex/LICENSE)
- `@symplek/cli` — [`packages/symplek-cli/LICENSE`](packages/symplek-cli/LICENSE)
- `@symplek/mcp` — [`packages/symplek-mcp/LICENSE`](packages/symplek-mcp/LICENSE)
- `@symplek/harness` — [`packages/symplek-harness/LICENSE`](packages/symplek-harness/LICENSE)
- `@symplek/testing` — [`packages/symplek-testing/LICENSE`](packages/symplek-testing/LICENSE)
- `@symplek/devtools` — [`packages/symplek-devtools/LICENSE`](packages/symplek-devtools/LICENSE)

Copyright (c) 2026 Symplek Contributors.

## BUSL-1.1 — `@symplek/pro`

`@symplek/pro` is licensed under the **Business Source Licence 1.1**.

- **Change Date:** 2030-04-24
- **Change Licence:** MIT
- **Additional Use Grant:** You may use the licensed work in production provided you are an individual or a team with fewer than five (5) developers. You may also use, copy, modify, and redistribute the licensed work, provided that you may not offer the licensed work to third parties as a hosted or managed service that competes with offerings from the Licensor.

Full text: [`packages/symplek-pro/LICENSE`](packages/symplek-pro/LICENSE).

On the Change Date (2030-04-24), the version of `@symplek/pro` published as of that date automatically converts to MIT. Future versions remain under BUSL-1.1 until their own Change Dates.

## Questions

For commercial licensing inquiries about `@symplek/pro`, email **licensing@symplek.dev**.
